WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.021 --> 00:00:02.091
- I'm ready to see my old-ass self.

00:00:02.091 --> 00:00:03.328
Shit, let's see it.

00:00:03.328 --> 00:00:07.171
(zen music)

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.971
- I've always liked old people.

00:00:09.971 --> 00:00:12.040
Like I've just thought
old men are cool looking

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.950
so I'm hoping like I'm
a cool-looking old man.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.126
But I could also see myself being like

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:17.523
a creepy-looking old man.

00:00:17.523 --> 00:00:21.576
- I take care of myself, I
work out, I ride my bike a lot.

00:00:21.576 --> 00:00:23.070
- I smoke cigarettes daily.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.947
Sometimes it can be anywhere from like

00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:27.549
five to 15, it really just
depends on the mood I'm in

00:00:27.549 --> 00:00:29.374
and how much I got going on.

00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:32.286
- I know my family and we
pretty much look the same.

00:00:32.286 --> 00:00:34.046
I don't think I'm gonna age much.

00:00:34.046 --> 00:00:35.325
- I'm a little scared,
I'm a little worried,

00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:36.675
I'm a little nervous.

00:00:54.473 --> 00:00:58.003
- My face is slimmer, I think too,

00:00:58.003 --> 00:00:59.509
which is interesting.

00:00:59.509 --> 00:01:02.227
- OK, alright, not that different really.

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:03.593
The bags under my eyes have gotten

00:01:03.593 --> 00:01:06.885
a little bigger, my face is
like sagging a little more.

00:01:06.885 --> 00:01:09.033
- Yeah, the face seems to be thinning out

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:12.112
a little bit in 10 years from now.

00:01:12.112 --> 00:01:15.179
- And I'm starting to look a little old.

00:01:15.179 --> 00:01:17.264
- I don't know, it's
mostly under the eyes,

00:01:17.264 --> 00:01:20.693
that it's really increasing
and I'm getting more

00:01:20.693 --> 00:01:23.579
like crows feet kind of things over here.

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:26.666
- OK, now I'm starting
to see some sort of more

00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:29.247
sorta lines here in the cheeks.

00:01:29.247 --> 00:01:33.226
- Oo, I think I am in the grave

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.954
already actually (chuckles).

00:01:34.954 --> 00:01:36.181
I look dead.

00:01:37.361 --> 00:01:38.718
- I look old, but I look healthy.

00:01:38.718 --> 00:01:40.180
I look like a healthy old guy.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.228
- I'm seeing a lot more like lines

00:01:42.228 --> 00:01:45.524
in my face here, the eyes, like around

00:01:45.524 --> 00:01:48.425
the eyes look a little just aged.

00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:49.684
- This is probably from looking at

00:01:49.684 --> 00:01:54.129
computers all of my life,
looking at a lot of screens.

00:01:55.429 --> 00:01:58.120
- Those eyes have seen things.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.763
- Yeah, I mean, it's just weird.

00:01:59.763 --> 00:02:02.547
It's so weird to see
this photo and just like

00:02:02.547 --> 00:02:04.520
almost like see yourself as a grandfather

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.981
or like a great-grandfather.

00:02:06.981 --> 00:02:08.977
It's wild, man, I mean,

00:02:08.977 --> 00:02:11.496
it definitely makes me appreciate the now.

00:02:16.547 --> 00:02:18.947
75 as a smoker, you're looking like

00:02:18.947 --> 00:02:22.648
you're like picking out
the casket to be honest.

00:02:22.648 --> 00:02:25.677
Like it's pretty bad.

00:02:25.677 --> 00:02:28.157
Yeah, man, this is a wakeup call for sure.

00:02:30.019 --> 00:02:31.854
- We have one time to do this life.

00:02:31.854 --> 00:02:33.091
We have one body.

00:02:33.091 --> 00:02:34.531
We have to take care of ourselves.

00:02:34.531 --> 00:02:35.502
- I look at this photo and I go,

00:02:35.502 --> 00:02:37.657
"That guy doesn't look
like he feels good."

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.342
- When you're young, you feel like

00:02:39.342 --> 00:02:42.434
you're invincible, but
being pushed in the face

00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:44.931
with this image of
myself way down the road

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:48.025
in my life reminds me
like everything I do today

00:02:48.025 --> 00:02:50.618
is gonna have an effect
on me later and I need to

00:02:50.618 --> 00:02:53.506
be fucking careful with
what I put in my body,

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.522
how I treat my body because I want to

00:02:55.522 --> 00:02:57.890
live to a ripe old age.

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.585
- I mean, I need to find a man now 'cause

00:02:59.585 --> 00:03:03.286
if I'm looking around for
a man looking like this,

00:03:03.286 --> 00:03:04.910
it ain't gonna happen.

